# Pull requests

Policy lives in AGENTS.md. Skills: `.cursor/skills/open-pull-request/` and `review-pull-request/`.

- Feature work goes on a branch and a GitHub PR against `main`. Do not push features to `main`.
- One concern per PR. Do not commit `.env` or keys.
- Before opening: architecture-guard, pytest, fixture eval.
- Reviews: architecture and SOLID first, then tests, then nits. Block Wald-invariant breaks.
- Do not merge, force-push `main`, or skip hooks unless the user asked.
- Origin `docs/` stay frozen unless the PR is explicitly about them.
